+From 3365d5a99e648a51a638d68c384005765cd7a8c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Rex Lu <rex.lu@mediatek.com>
+Date: Fri, 6 Sep 2024 15:32:05 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH 3/8] mtk: mt76: mt7996: Fix call trace happened when wed
+ attach fail
