+---
+[v2] net: ethernet: mtk_wed: refactor RRO RX driver initialization flow
+
+Refactor RRO (Receive Reorder) RX driver initialization sequence for
+better reliability and proper resource allocation.
+---
+v2: Improved error handling in init flow.
+v1: Initial initialization refactoring.
+---
+
+From dadf8f5d48c6cc9b8e6f72fada3218d26503c612 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
